{"Allow you to rotate Link on the Equipment menu with the C-buttons\nUse C-Up or C-Down to reset Link's rotation", "在装备菜单中用 C 键旋转林克，C 上／C 下恢复默认朝向。"},
{"Allow you to rotate Link on the Equipment menu with the D-pad\nUse D-pad Up or D-pad Down to reset Link's rotation", "在装备菜单中用方向键旋转林克，上下方向键恢复默认朝向。"},
{"Allow you to rotate Link on the Equipment menu with the Right Stick\nYou can zoom in by pointing up and reset Link's rotation by pointing down", "在装备菜单中用右摇杆旋转林克，向上可放大，向下恢复默认朝向。"},
{"Allows Gossip Stones to provide hints on item locations. Hints mentioning \"Way of the Hero\" indicate a location that holds an item required to beat the seed.\n\nNo hints - No hints will be given at all.\n\nNeed Nothing - Hints are always available from Gossip Stones.\n\nNeed Stone of Agony - Hints are only available after obtaining the Stone of Agony.\n\nNeed Mask of Truth - Hints are only available whilst wearing the Mask of Truth.\n", "让闲话石提示物品位置。“英雄之路”表示该地点有完成种子所必需的物品。\n\n无提示：不提供提示。\n\n无要求：随时可从闲话石获得提示。\n\n需要苦闷石：获得苦闷石后才可查看。\n\n需要真实面具：佩戴真实面具时才可查看。"},
{"Allows Ice Arrows to melt red ice.\nMay require a room reload if toggled during gameplay.", "冰箭可融化红冰。游戏中开关此设置后可能需要重新进入房间。"},
{"Allows Light Arrows to activate sun switches.\nMay require a room reload if toggled during gameplay.", "光箭可触发太阳开关。游戏中开关此设置后可能需要重新进入房间。"},
{"Allows Link to freely change age by playing the Song of Time.\nTime Blocks can still be used properly.\n\nRequirements:\n- Obtained the Ocarina of Time (depends on selection)\n- Obtained the Song of Time\n- Obtained the Master Sword\n- Not within range of Time Block\n- Not within range of Ocarina playing spots", "吹奏时之歌可切换林克的年龄，时之方块仍可正常使用。\n条件：获得时之笛（依所选规则）、时之歌和大师之剑；不在时之方块或吹奏触发点附近。"},
{"Allows a more in-depth perspective of time spent in a certain map.", "更详细地查看在指定地图中花费的时间。"},
{"Allows any item to be equipped, regardless of age\nAlso allows Child to use Adult strength upgrades", "任何年龄均可装备所有物品，孩童也能使用成人的力量升级。"},
{"Allows bombchus to explode out of bounds\nSimilar to GameCube and Wii VC", "允许炸弹鼠在场景边界外爆炸，类似 GameCube 和 Wii VC 版本。"},
{"Allows child to use bow with arrows.\nAllows adult to use slingshot with seeds.\n\nRequires glitches or 'Timeless Equipment' cheat to equip.", "孩童可使用弓箭，成人可使用弹弓。\n需要利用漏洞或开启“装备不受年龄限制”才能装备。"},
{"Allows controller navigation of the SOH menu bar (Settings, Enhancements,...)\nCAUTION: This will disable game inputs while the menubar is visible.\n\nD-pad to move between items, A to select, and X to grab focus on the menu bar", "允许用手柄操作设置、增强等菜单。\n注意：菜单栏显示时，游戏操作会暂停接收输入。\n\n方向键移动，A 键选择，X 键聚焦菜单栏。"},
{"Allows dogs to follow you anywhere you go, even if you leave the market", "即使离开城下町，狗也能继续跟随。"},
{"Allows equipment to be removed by toggling it off on\nthe equipment subscreen.", "在装备子菜单中再次选择装备，可以将其卸下。"},
{"Allows equipping the tunic and boots to c-buttons", "允许将服装和靴子分配到 C 键。"},
{"Allows exiting Hyrule Castle Market Town to Hyrule Field at night by speaking to the guard next to the gate.", "夜间与城门旁的守卫交谈，可从城下町前往海拉鲁平原。"},
{"Allows for aiming with the right stick in:\n-First-Person/C-Up view\n-Weapon Aiming", "允许在第一人称、C 上视角和武器瞄准时使用右摇杆。"},
{"Allows graves to be pulled when child during the day", "孩童在白天也可拉动墓碑。"},
{"Allows strength to be toggled on and off by pressing A on the strength upgrade in the equipment subscreen of the pause menu (This allows performing some glitches that require the player to not have strength).", "在暂停菜单的装备页，对力量升级按 A 键可开关效果，便于使用要求没有力量升级的漏洞。"},
{"Allows the Lon Lon Ranch obstacle course reward to be shared across time periods", "隆隆牧场障碍赛奖励可在两个年代共享。"},
{"Allows the bunny hood to be equipped normally from the pause menu as adult.", "成年林克也可从暂停菜单正常装备兔子头套。"},
{"Allows the cursor on the pause menu to be over any slot. Sometimes required in rando to select certain items.", "暂停菜单的光标可停在任意格，随机模式有时需要此功能来选择特定物品。"},
