{"Disabled: Paths vanish more the higher the resolution (Z-fighting is based on resolution)\nConsistent: Certain paths vanish the same way in all resolutions\nNo Vanish: Paths do not vanish, Link seems to sink in to some paths\nThis might affect other decal effects\n", "禁用：分辨率越高，道路因深度冲突而消失越明显。\n一致：所有分辨率下以相同方式消失。\n不消失：道路不消失，但林克可能看起来陷入地面。\n此设置也可能影响其他贴花效果。"},
{"Disables Black Bar Letterboxes during cutscenes and Z-targeting\nNote: there may be minor visual glitches that were covered up by the black bars\nPlease disable this setting before reporting a bug", "取消过场和锁定时的上下黑边。可能暴露原本被黑边遮住的轻微画面问题，报告问题前请先关闭此选项。"},
