{"Disables grottos rotating with the camera. To be used in conjunction with mods that want to replace grottos with 3D objects.", "洞穴入口不再跟随镜头旋转，适合使用 3D 洞穴入口模型的模组。"},
{"Disables heart drops, but not heart placements, like from a Deku Scrub running off\nThis simulates Hero Mode from other games in the series", "取消随机爱心掉落，但不移除固定爱心，例如逃跑的德库商人留下的爱心。模拟系列其他游戏的英雄模式。"},
{"Disables random drops, except from the Goron Pot, Dampe, and bosses", "取消随机掉落，鼓隆大罐子、丹培和 Boss 的掉落除外。"},
