{"Disables the music change when getting close to enemies. Useful for hearing your custom music for each scene more often.", "靠近敌人时不切换音乐，便于持续听到场景的自定义音乐。"},
{"Disables the voice audio when Navi calls you", "关闭娜薇呼唤林克时的语音。"},
