{"Enables Debug Mode, allowing you to select maps with L + R + Z, noclip with L + D-pad Right, and open the debug menu with L on the pause screen", "启用调试模式。L＋R＋Z 选择地图，L＋方向右穿墙，暂停画面按 L 打开调试菜单。"},
{"Enables Ivan the Fairy upon the next map change. Player 2 can control Ivan and press the C-Buttons to use items and mess with Player 1!", "下次切换地图时启用精灵伊万。玩家二可控制伊万，并按 C 键使用物品干扰玩家一。"},
{"Enables Skulltula Debug, when moving the cursor in the menu above various map icons (boss key, compass, map screen locations, etc) will set the GS bits in that area.\nUSE WITH CAUTION AS IT DOES NOT UPDATE THE GS COUNT.", "启用金骷髅蜘蛛调试。菜单光标移过 Boss 钥匙、罗盘、地图位置等图标时，会设置对应区域的蜘蛛标记。\n请谨慎使用：此功能不会更新蜘蛛总数。"},
{"Enables additional Trap variants.", "启用更多种类的陷阱。"},
{"Enables free camera control\nNote: You must remap C buttons off of the right stick in the controller config menu, and map the camera stick to the right stick.", "启用自由镜头。需要在控制器设置中将 C 键移出右摇杆，并将镜头摇杆映射到右摇杆。"},
{"Enables randomizing all unlocked cosmetics when you enter a new scene.", "进入新场景时，随机设置所有未锁定的外观选项。"},
{"Enables randomizing all unlocked music and sound effects when you enter a new scene.", "进入新场景时，随机替换所有未锁定的音乐和音效。"},
{"Enables text to speech for in game dialog", "朗读游戏内对话。"},
{"Enables the console window, allowing you to input commands, type help for some examples", "启用控制台，可输入命令；输入 help 查看示例。"},
{"Enables the registry editor", "启用寄存器编辑器。"},
{"Enabling this adds a pack of 10 beans to the item pool and changes the Magic Bean Salesman to sell a random item at a price of 60 rupees.", "将一包 10 颗魔法豆加入物品池，魔法豆商人改为以 60 卢比出售随机物品。"},
{"Enabling this changes Medigoron, Granny and the Carpet Salesman to sell a random item once at a high price (100 for Granny, 200 for the others).\nA Giant's Knife and a pack of Bombchus will be added to the item pool, and one of the bottles will contain a Blue Potion.\n\nOn (no hints) - Salesmen will be included but won't tell you what you'll get.\nOn (with hints) - Salesmen will be included and you'll know what you're buying.\n\nGranny's item will only be offered after you have traded in the Odd Mushroom when Shuffle Adult Trade is on. Otherwise when off, you will need to have found the Claim Check to buy her item (simulating the trade quest is complete).", "让大鼓隆商人、婆婆和飞毯商人各出售一件随机物品，婆婆售价 100 卢比，另外两位为 200。\n物品池中增加巨人之刀和一包炸弹鼠，其中一个瓶子装有蓝色药水。\n\n开启（无提示）：商人不告知商品内容。\n开启（有提示）：购买前可知道商品内容。\n\n启用成年交易打乱时，须交出奇怪的蘑菇才能购买婆婆的商品；未启用时，须先找到兑换券，视为完成交易任务。"},
{"Enabling this shuffles the Fairy Ocarina and the Ocarina of Time into the item pool.\n\nThis will require finding an Ocarina before being able to play songs.", "将妖精之笛与时之笛加入物品池。\n\n找到笛子后才能演奏歌曲。"},
