{"Mirrors the world horizontally\n\n- Always: Always mirror the world\n- Random: Randomly decide to mirror the world on each scene change\n- Random (Seeded): Scenes are mirrored based on the current randomizer seed/file\n- Dungeons: Mirror the world in Dungeons\n- Dungeons (Vanilla): Mirror the world in vanilla Dungeons\n- Dungeons (MQ): Mirror the world in MQ Dungeons\n- Dungeons Random: Randomly decide to mirror the world in Dungeons\n- Dungeons Random (Seeded): Dungeons are mirrored based on the current randomizer seed/file\n", "水平镜像世界。\n始终：所有场景镜像。\n随机：每次切换场景随机决定。\n按种子随机：由当前随机种子或存档决定。\n迷宫：仅迷宫镜像。\n原版迷宫／里世界迷宫：仅对应类型镜像。\n迷宫随机：迷宫每次随机决定。\n迷宫按种子随机：由种子或存档决定迷宫是否镜像。"},
