{"Modifies all fall damage\n2x: Can survive all fall damage from the start of the game\n4x: Can only survive short fall damage from the start of the game\n8x: Cannot survive any fall damage from the start of the game\n16x: Can survive all fall damage with max health without double defense\n32x: Can survive all fall damage with max health and double defense\n64x: Can survive short fall damage with double defense\n128x: Cannot survive fall damage", "调整坠落伤害。\n2 倍：初始生命可承受所有坠落伤害。\n4 倍：初始生命仅可承受短距离坠落。\n8 倍：初始生命无法承受坠落。\n16 倍：满生命可承受所有坠落伤害。\n32 倍：满生命且双倍防御可承受所有坠落伤害。\n64 倍：双倍防御下可承受短距离坠落。\n128 倍：无法承受坠落伤害。"},
{"Modifies all sources of damage not affected by other sliders\n2x: Can survive all common attacks from the start of the game\n4x: Dies in 1 hit to any substantial attack from the start of the game\n8x: Can only survive trivial damage from the start of the game\n16x: Can survive all common attacks with max health without double defense\n32x: Can survive all common attacks with max health and double defense\n64x: Can survive trivial damage with max health without double defense\n128x: Can survive trivial damage with max health and double defense\n256x: Cannot survive damage", "调整未被其他倍率设置覆盖的伤害。\n2 倍：初始生命可承受常见攻击。\n4 倍：初始生命会被较强攻击一击击倒。\n8 倍：初始生命仅可承受轻微伤害。\n16 倍：满生命可承受常见攻击。\n32 倍：满生命且双倍防御可承受常见攻击。\n64 倍：满生命仅可承受轻微伤害。\n128 倍：满生命且双倍防御仅可承受轻微伤害。\n256 倍：任何伤害都会致命。"},
{"Modifies damage taken after bonking.", "调整撞墙后受到的伤害。"},
{"Modifies damage taken after falling into a void\n2x: Can survive void damage from the start of the game\n4x: Cannot survive void damage from the start of the game\n8x: Can survive void damage twice with max health without double defense\n16x: Can survive void damage with max health without double defense\n32x: Can survive void damage with max health and double defense\n64x: Cannot survive void damage", "调整掉入深渊后的伤害。\n2 倍：初始生命可承受一次。\n4 倍：初始生命无法承受。\n8 倍：满生命无双倍防御可承受两次。\n16 倍：满生命无双倍防御可承受一次。\n32 倍：满生命且双倍防御可承受一次。\n64 倍：无法承受深渊伤害。"},
