{"Replaces fixed enemies throughout the game with a random enemy. Bosses, mini-bosses and a few specific regular enemies are excluded.\nEnemies that need more than Deku Nuts + either Deku Sticks or a sword to kill are excluded from spawning in \"clear enemy\" rooms.\n\n- Random: Enemies are randomized every time you load a room\n- Random (Seeded): Enemies are randomized based on the current randomizer seed/file\n", "将固定敌人替换为随机敌人，主要 Boss、小 Boss 和少数特殊敌人除外。\n要求清除敌人的房间，不生成仅靠德库果实配合木棒或剑无法击败的敌人。\n随机：每次载入房间重新随机。\n按种子随机：由当前随机种子或存档决定。"},
