{"Resolution scale. Multiplies output resolution by this value, on each axis relative to window size.\nLower values may improve performance.\nValues above 100% can be used for super-sampling, as an intensive but highly effective form of anti-aliasing.\n\nDefault: 100%", "相对于窗口大小，按比例调整两个方向的渲染分辨率。降低可改善性能，超过 100% 可进行超采样抗锯齿，但开销较大。\n默认：100%"},
