{"Set most of the elements to use margins\nSome elements with default position will not be affected\nElements without Anchor or Hidden will not be turned on", "让大部分元素使用边距。\n部分处于默认位置的元素不受影响。\n未固定对齐或隐藏的元素不会启用。"},
{"Set the Beta Quest world to explore. *WARNING* Changing this will reset your game.\nCtrl+Click to type in a value.", "选择要探索的 Beta Quest 世界。注意：修改会重置游戏。\n按 Ctrl 并点击可直接输入数值。"},
{"Set the number of trials required to enter Ganon's Tower.", "设置进入加侬塔所需完成的试炼数量。"},
{"Sets aspect ratio to 4:3 and lowers resolution to 240p, the N64's native resolution", "将画面比例设为 4:3，分辨率降至 N64 原生的 240p。"},
{"Sets how many hints will be useful.\n\nUseless - Only junk hints.\n\nBalanced - Recommended hint spread.\n\nStrong - More useful hints.\n\nVery Strong - Many powerful hints.", "设置有用提示的数量。\n\n无用：仅提供杂项提示。\n\n均衡：推荐分布。\n\n较强：更多有用提示。\n\n很强：大量关键提示。"},
{"Sets how many items are replaced by ice traps.\n\nOff - No ice traps.\n\nNormal - Only Ice Traps from the base item pool are shuffled in.\n\nExtra - Chance to replace added junk items with additional ice traps.\n\nMayhem - All added junk items will be Ice Traps.\n\nOnslaught - All junk items will be replaced by Ice Traps, even those in the base pool.", "设置被冰冻陷阱替换的物品数量。\n\n关闭：没有冰冻陷阱。\n\n普通：仅使用基础物品池中的冰冻陷阱。\n\n额外：新增杂项物品有概率变为冰冻陷阱。\n\n混乱：所有新增杂项物品均为冰冻陷阱。\n\n全面冰冻：包括基础池在内的全部杂项物品均被替换。"},
{"Sets how many major items appear in the item pool.\n\nPlentiful - Extra major items are added to the pool.\n\nBalanced - Original item pool.\n\nScarce - Some excess items are removed, including health upgrades.\n\nMinimal - Most excess items are removed.", "设置物品池中主要物品的数量。\n\n充裕：加入额外主要物品。\n\n均衡：原始物品池。\n\n稀少：移除部分多余物品，包括生命升级。\n\n极少：移除大部分多余物品。"},
{"Sets the amount of carpenters required to repair the bridge in Gerudo Valley.\n\nNormal - All 4 carpenters are required to be saved.\n\nFast - Only the bottom left carpenter requires rescuing.\n\nOpen - The bridge is repaired from the start.\n\nOnly \"Normal\" is compatible with Gerudo Fortress Key Rings.", "设置修复格鲁德谷桥梁所需营救的木匠数量。\n\n普通：营救全部 4 名木匠。\n\n快速：只需营救左下方的木匠。\n\n开放：桥梁从一开始就已修复。\n\n只有“普通”兼容格鲁德要塞钥匙串。"},
{"Sets the brightness of controller LEDs. 0% brightness = LEDs off.", "设置手柄灯光亮度，0% 表示关闭。"},
{"Sets the desired visibility behavior for the button outline/background layers. Useful for custom input viewers.", "设置按键边框和背景图层的显示规则，适用于自定义输入显示器。"},
{"Sets the difficulty of hints.\n\nObscure - Hints are unique for each item, but the writing may be cryptic.\nEx: Kokiri Sword > a butter knife\n\nAmbiguous - Hints are clearly written, but may refer to more than one item.\nEx: Kokiri Sword > a sword\n\nClear - Hints are clearly written and are unique for each item.\nEx: Kokiri Sword > the Kokiri Sword", "设置提示的难度。\n\n隐晦：每件物品有独特提示，但表述含蓄，例如科奇里之剑称为“黄油刀”。\n\n模糊：表述清楚，但可能指多件物品，例如称为“一把剑”。\n\n明确：清楚且唯一，例如直接称为“科奇里之剑”。"},
{"Sets the distance to move the analog stick in the input viewer. Useful for custom input viewers.", "设置输入显示器中的摇杆移动距离，适用于自定义输入显示器。"},
{"Sets the distance to move the right stick in the input viewer. Useful for custom input viewers.", "设置输入显示器中的右摇杆移动距离，适用于自定义输入显示器。"},
{"Sets the number of Ganon's Trials required to dispel the barrier.\n\nSkip - No Trials are required and the barrier is already dispelled.\n\nSet Number - Select a number of trials that will be required from theslider below. Which specific trials you need to complete will be random.\n\nRandom Number - A Random number and set of trials will be required.", "设置解除结界所需完成的加侬试炼数量。\n\n跳过：无需试炼，结界已解除。\n\n指定数量：使用下方滑块选择数量，具体试炼随机决定。\n\n随机数量：随机决定试炼数量及其种类。"},
{"Sets the number of Master Quest Dungeons that are shuffled into the pool.\n\nNone - All Dungeons will be their Vanilla versions.\n\nSet Number - Select a number of dungeons that will be their Master Quest versions using the slider below. Which dungeons are set to be the Master Quest variety will be random.\n\nRandom Number - A Random number and set of dungeons will be their Master Quest varieties.\n\nSelection - Leave unchecked for Vanilla and checked for Master Quest.", "设置混入的大师模式迷宫数量。\n\n无：所有迷宫均为原版。\n\n指定数量：通过滑块选择数量，具体迷宫随机决定。\n\n随机数量：随机决定数量与迷宫。\n\n自行选择：未勾选使用原版，勾选使用大师模式。"},
{"Sets the on screen size of the input viewer", "设置输入显示器在屏幕上的大小。"},
