{"Some cosmetic options may not apply if you have any mods that provide custom models for the cosmetic option.\n\nFor example, if you have custom Link model, then the Link's Hair color option will most likely not apply.", "部分外观选项可能无法作用于模组提供的自定义模型。\n\n例如，使用自定义林克模型时，林克发色选项很可能不会生效。"},
{"Some custom sequences may have notes that are too high for the game's audio engine to play. Enabling this checkbox will cause these notes to drop a couple of octaves so they can still harmonize with the other notes of the sequence.", "部分自定义曲目的音高超出游戏音频引擎范围。开启后将这些音符降低几个八度，以便与其他音符保持和谐。"},
{"Song Locations", "歌曲地点"},
{"Song locations", "歌曲地点"},
{"Song locations - Songs will only appear at locations that normally teach songs.\n\nDungeon rewards - Songs appear after beating a major dungeon boss.\nThe 4 remaining songs are located at:\n  - Zelda's lullaby location\n  - Ice Cavern's Serenade of Water location\n  - Bottom of the Well Lens of Truth location\n  - Gerudo Training Ground's Ice Arrows location\n\nAnywhere - Songs can appear at any location.", "歌曲地点：歌曲只出现在原本传授歌曲的地点。\n\n迷宫奖励：击败主要迷宫首领后获得歌曲。剩余四首位于：\n塞尔达摇篮曲地点；\n冰之洞窟的水之小夜曲地点；\n井底的真实之眼地点；\n格鲁德训练场的冰之箭地点。\n\n任意地点：歌曲可出现在任何地点。"},
