{"Standard Rewards - Greg does not change logic, Greg does not help obtain GBK, max number of rewards on slider does not change.\n\nGreg as Reward - Greg does change logic (can be part of expected path for obtaining GBK), Greg helps obtain GBK, max number of rewards on slider increases by 1 to account for Greg. \n\nGreg as Wildcard - Greg does not change logic, Greg helps obtain GBK, max number of rewards on slider does not change.", "标准奖励：格雷格不影响逻辑、不帮助获得加侬首领钥匙，奖励数量上限不变。\n\n格雷格计为奖励：影响逻辑，可成为获得钥匙的必经步骤；帮助获得钥匙，奖励数量上限增加 1。\n\n格雷格作为替代：不影响逻辑，但帮助获得钥匙，奖励数量上限不变。"},
{"Standard Rewards - Greg does not change logic, Greg does not help open the bridge, max number of rewards on slider does not change.\n\nGreg as Reward - Greg does change logic (can be part of expected path for opening bridge), Greg helps open bridge, max number of rewards on slider increases by 1 to account for Greg. \n\nGreg as Wildcard - Greg does not change logic, Greg helps open the bridge, max number of rewards on slider does not change.", "标准奖励：格雷格不影响逻辑、不帮助开桥，奖励数量滑块的上限不变。\n\n格雷格计为奖励：格雷格影响逻辑，可能成为开桥的必经步骤；可帮助开桥，奖励数量上限增加 1。\n\n格雷格作为替代：格雷格不影响逻辑，但可帮助开桥，奖励数量上限不变。"},
{"Standing near the pedestal for the frogs in Zora's River will tell you the reward for the frogs' ocarina game.", "靠近卓拉河青蛙的平台时，可得知青蛙笛子游戏的奖励。"},
